              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LynnNM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great and very easy recipe. We made it last night for dinner. Did everything exactly according to the recipe, but we found that the parsley made it a bit dry as the crab legs were sautéing. We added more butter, which helped. We also added lemon wedges at the table for added zip. We will definitely be making this again many times!",
